"""The Help section's texts (#help, dev#3) into texts.js, in all twelve languages.

    python3 tools/help_texts.py [<vscode-emkay checkout>]

{cmd.open}, {cmd.addLanguage} … are the extension's own command names in that
language (its package.nls.<lang>.json), so the page says exactly what VS Code
shows. Run again after changing a text here.
"""
